<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<gpx version="1.1" creator="book_route.py" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1">
<metadata><name>Sherar Burn and Trillium Lake Dam Loop (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>or-vielbig-2e:143-1: route read from the book's text and sketch map. One trkseg per waypoint pair, in order; segment sources are in the trk desc. Geometry from OSM (ODbL, (c) OpenStreetMap contributors) and USFS EDW (public domain) where marked; 'straight' segments are off-trail connectors, not traced.</desc></metadata>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park</name><desc>source: DB trailhead pin th:trillium-lake-sno-park (OSM parking way/148019331); confidence: high; pdf_page: 143; book_elev_ft: 3830</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction</name><desc>source: as in or-vielbig-2e_142-2: OSM junction of Trillium Lake Road NF 2656 and NF 2650-131; confidence: high; pdf_page: 144; book_elev_ft: 3600</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286242" lon="-121.737580"><ele>1117.5</ele><name>Pioneer Graves junction</name><desc>source: as in or-vielbig-2e_142-2: OSM junction of East Chimney Rock Road and NF 2650-131; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 145</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280905" lon="-121.741343"><ele>1137.8</ele><name>Westside Divide</name><desc>source: OSM junction of Sherar Burn Road NF 2613 and Still Creek Road NF 2612 (as in 142-2); confidence: high; pdf_page: 145; book_elev_ft: 3720; quote: Either way, ski to the Westside Divide (see Trillium Lake Loop)</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.270703" lon="-121.746456"><ele>1220.2</ele><name>Top of the clearcut</name><desc>source: OSM NF 2613 node 0.80 mi from the divide (osm_lookup along); DEM 4,003 ft; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 145; quote: ski up the Sherar Burn road 0.8 mile to the top of an almost mile-long clearcut</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.266000" lon="-121.747500"><ele>1151.6</ele><name>Clearcut east edge</name><desc>source: east edge of the clearcut opening on the topo; map 33 draws the dotted line down the clearcut's east side; DEM 3,778 ft; confidence: low; pdf_page: 147; quote: Descend on steep slopes into the clearcut over mixed, rolling terrain to its bottom at a crossing of Mud Creek.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.261500" lon="-121.748000"><ele>1087.2</ele><name>Bottom of the clearcut (east edge)</name><desc>source: south-east corner of the clearcut opening on the topo; DEM 3,567 ft; confidence: low; pdf_page: 147</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.260000" lon="-121.750900"><ele>1080.3</ele><name>Mud Creek crossing</name><desc>source: on OSM stream way/546769895 Mud Creek; DEM 3,544 ft; confidence: low; pdf_page: 145</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.256921" lon="-121.749319"><ele>1082.7</ele><name>Lower Ridge road near the quarry</name><desc>source: OSM Trillium Lake Loop Road (NF 2656, the book's Lower Ridge road) node 0.93 mi from the 2656/2612 junction, 0.1 mi north of Quarry Junction (start of OSM Forest Road 2656 track, the Valhalla road; DEM 3,558 ft vs the book's 3,560) as map 33 draws it; quarry polygon just east; confidence: medium; pdf_page: 145; quote: Ski 0.4 mile to the Lower Ridge road, and here, near the quarry, turn left and ski north</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.265815" lon="-121.737354"><ele>1102.8</ele><name>Junction east of the dam (2656 / 2612)</name><desc>source: OSM junction of NF 2656 and Still Creek Road NF 2612 (as in 142-2); confidence: high; pdf_page: 147</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280905" lon="-121.741343"><ele>1137.8</ele><name>Westside Divide (loop closed)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high; pdf_page: 145; quote: complete the loop after crossing the Trillium Lake dam</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.286242" lon="-121.737580"><ele>1117.5</ele><name>Pioneer Graves junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: medium</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.280208" lon="-121.733236"><ele>1103.1</ele><name>Airstrip junction (return)</name><desc>source: as above; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="45.285259" lon="-121.727970"><ele>1156.8</ele><name>Trillium Lake Sno-Park (finish)</name><desc>source: as start; confidence: high</desc></wpt>
<trk><name>Sherar Burn and Trillium Lake Dam Loop (from Trillium Lake Sno-Park)</name><desc>1. Trillium Lake Sno-Park -&gt; Airstrip junction: osm (high), 0.48 mi | 2. Airstrip junction -&gt; Pioneer Graves junction: osm (medium), 0.52 mi | 3. Pioneer Graves junction -&gt; Westside Divide: osm (medium), 0.48 mi | 4. Westside Divide -&gt; Top of the clearcut: osm (high), 0.80 mi | 5. Top of the clearcut -&gt; Clearcut east edge: straight (low), 0.33 mi | 6. Clearcut east edge -&gt; Bottom of the clearcut (east edge): straight (low), 0.31 mi | 7. Bottom of the clearcut (east edge) -&gt; Mud Creek crossing: straight (low), 0.18 mi | 8. Mud Creek crossing -&gt; Lower Ridge road near the quarry: straight (low), 0.23 mi | 9. Lower Ridge road near the quarry -&gt; Junction east of the dam (2656 / 2612): osm (high), 0.93 mi | 10. Junction east of the dam (2656 / 2612) -&gt; Westside Divide (loop closed): osm (high), 1.41 mi | 11. Westside Divide (loop closed) -&gt; Pioneer Graves junction (return): osm (medium), 0.48 mi | 12. Pioneer Graves junction (return) -&gt; Airstrip junction (return): osm (medium), 0.52 mi | 13. Airstrip junction (return) -&gt; Trillium Lake Sno-Park (finish): osm (high), 0.48 mi</desc>
